          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP 315 Cardiff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I decided to get this one on my way home from Morinville after doing some caching in the area. It looked like it would be too bad, minus the mud. So naturally I decided to dig it out with my feet. I didn't realize exactly how much mud there was but my shoes and hands and pants were already dirty so I was determined to find it. Eventually I did managed to hit the cap after displacing a lot of mud. Thanks for another cap! {*FOUND*}&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
